00:09:56.778 --> 00:10:03.439
The rules based record, the one that restarted on August 18, 2026 with fixed five session

00:10:03.439 --> 00:10:09.759
holds, next open entries, stop or horizon exits, and no discretionary cells, shows matched

00:10:09.759 --> 00:10:15.359
window alpha versus the NASDAQ averaging minus 0.8% across 37 trades.

