00:10:47.899 --> 00:10:51.839
You can reproduce every number from the pick, the date, and the stop.

00:10:52.279 --> 00:10:56.799
That reproducibility is the product, and the book is still learning which families actually

00:10:56.799 --> 00:10:58.359
pay versus the NASDAQ.

00:10:59.135 --> 00:11:04.135
You hold a Canadian pipeline in a TFSA, the dividend lands in Canadian dollars.

00:11:04.675 --> 00:11:07.615
Part of the cash that funds it is US pipeline revenue.

00:11:08.175 --> 00:11:12.515
The loony firms from 71.30 cents to 72 cents US.

00:11:12.515 --> 00:11:18.075
Do you treat that as a yield cut or do you ignore it because the CAD check did not change?

00:11:18.715 --> 00:11:21.075
I would treat it as a cut in translated earnings.

00:11:21.615 --> 00:11:27.075
The nominal dividend can sit still while the U.S. cash converted back shrinks, and the

00:11:27.075 --> 00:11:30.715
effective yield on the position drops without a single distribution notice.

00:11:31.315 --> 00:11:34.315
That mechanism shows up in the first 30 minutes of a session.

00:11:34.735 --> 00:11:40.115
When cross-border flows can widen bid-ask spreads on dual-listed names by 3-5 cents.

00:11:40.115 --> 00:11:45.755
Professional desks hedge it with rolling three-month forward contracts size to about 40% of

00:11:45.755 --> 00:11:46.935
the US revenue weight.

00:11:47.195 --> 00:11:50.215
You are not running that desk, but you can copy the check.

00:11:50.715 --> 00:11:52.575
Pull the latest 10k segment note.

00:11:52.935 --> 00:11:58.055
Write down the US EBIT-DA share and set a price alert on the US dollar Canadian dollar

00:11:58.055 --> 00:12:00.155
pair at the 200-day moving average.

00:12:00.895 --> 00:12:03.495
Enbridge's US dollar activity is not abstract.

00:12:03.495 --> 00:12:10.535
contract, a $600 million US deal for Salt Creek midstream assets, and a $2.7 billion partnership

00:12:10.535 --> 00:12:16.035
with KKR and Apollo to fund pipe expansions, both sit on the same translation channel.

00:12:16.575 --> 00:12:22.715
Fordus by contrast has raised for 52 years, reaffirmed 4% to 6% annual dividend growth

00:12:22.715 --> 00:12:28.515
through 2030, and expects rate-based growth of 7% a year on assets that earn a regulated

00:12:28.515 --> 00:12:34.235
Canadian return, including approval for a larger Tilbury LNG expansion in British Columbia,

00:12:34.655 --> 00:12:39.855
worth about $2 billion, with a new 5-year capital plan due with third quarter results.

00:12:40.435 --> 00:12:44.155
The common misconception is that a stronger loony only hits exporters.

00:12:44.695 --> 00:12:50.055
The fix is to treat FX translation as a second risk factor on any holding whose cash flows

00:12:50.055 --> 00:12:50.955
cross the border.

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:56.896
Open your brokerage screener, filter TSX energy names with dividend growth streaks above

00:12:56.896 --> 00:13:01.196
of 20 years and yields above 3%, then write down the one

00:13:01.196 --> 00:13:02.636
with the lowest payout ratio.

